From 93f02e7ebf0f4f077e40a91b89c40c577337cf92 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ttabouch12 <ttabouch12@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 10:29:03 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 07/21] arm64: dts: exynos: add Samsung Galaxy Tab Active2 LTE

Add initial support for the Galaxy Tab Active2 LTE (SM-T395): eMMC,
microSD, QCA9377 Wi-Fi (SDIO) and Bluetooth (UART), keys, hall sensor,
S2MPU05, USB peripheral, Mali GPU, watchdog, STM FTS8 touchscreen and the
S6D7AA0 DSI panel (simple-framebuffer until exynos-drm takes over).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01C7LhHVoCsrpwunEL6xJhiW
---
